{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04575","headline":"入海二首 二 · 张说","name":"入海二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"海上三神山，逍遥集衆仙。\n灵心岂不同，变化无常全。\n龙伯如人类，一钓两鳌连。\n金台此沦没，玉真时播迁。\n问子劳何事，江上泣经年。\n隰中生红草，所美非美然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04575.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04575","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}